  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You roar, and the echoing storm moves in you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Descendants of Thunder.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you deal electricity damage with an unarmed strike, you may choose for half of the energy damage to be dealt as sonic damage. This causes a tremendous amount of noise, similar to the sound of a gunshot that may be heard from a great distance away.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> So long as you otherwise meet the prerequisites, this feat may be gained in place of any monk bonus feat, in place of a ninja trick or in place of any utility wild talent or dampened versatility bonus feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc99\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
